<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="KR3j0015-zh-ef4ececb" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>反經</title><editor role="translator">Li Guyin 李古寅</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>反經</title>北京：中國文史出版社，2008</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#KR3j0015"><title xml:lang="och">長短經</title></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="zh">modern Chinese</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2025-11-04T01:28:57.231+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="KR3j0015-start"><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:30:02.717+09:00">制作车子的人，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:30:18.256+09:00">唯恐别人不能富贵，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:31:05.361+09:00">制作弓箭的人，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:31:11.41+09:00">唯恐不能伤人，而没人买箭。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:31:40.794+09:00">难道他们有本能的爱憎之心吗？</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:31:51.23+09:00">不是，这是由于技术、职业的缘故而促使他们这样做。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:32:36.117+09:00">从这些事例可以看出，现在积极进取的人和奔赴四方的游侠</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:32:46.861+09:00">一旦读了纵横谋略之书，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:32:53.812+09:00">就盼天下大乱;</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:33:04.79+09:00">通晓了兵法之数，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:33:14.293+09:00">就希望发生战争。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:39:32.571+09:00">这是人情世故的</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:39:47.046+09:00">必然道理。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:44:23.409+09:00">所以先师孔子深究它的根本，也忧虑它的弊端，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:45:15.884+09:00">于是便作《春秋》</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:45:21.112+09:00">以宣扬王道；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:45:21.112+09:00">著《孝经》</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:45:21.112+09:00">以褒奖德行。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:46:37.387+09:00">防微杜渐，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:46:52.107+09:00">这是圣人著述创作的本意啊！</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:46:52.108+09:00">预先有所约束。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:48:16.497+09:00">*然而制定政策治理国家，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:48:55.605+09:00">当这种政策出现弊病的时候，必然要出乱子。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:49:09.464+09:00">如果一旦出了乱子，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:49:14.469+09:00">又怎么去挽救它呢？</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:50:59.373+09:00">因此，统治天下，管理人民，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:51:22.522+09:00">很少听说有因循守旧，沿袭旧制的。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:51:40.953+09:00">夏、商、周三代不同的礼制，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:51:53.941+09:00">春秋五霸不同的治法。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:52:14.534+09:00">这并不是故意反其道而行之，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:52:52.354+09:00">而是为了补漏洞，救偏颇。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:53:00.717+09:00">所以，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:53:13.313+09:00">国家的外貌虽然一样，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:53:27.959+09:00">但治国之道一定不同；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:54:21.765+09:00">圣哲们圣明的风格相同，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:58:31.446+09:00">但帝王们的名号却往往有别。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:58:54.871+09:00">这难道不是随时确定自己的管理模式，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:59:11.505+09:00">根据过去的历史经验，顺应客观规律，而成就自己的事业吗？</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:59:37.003+09:00">根据此时此地的情况，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T01:59:49.493+09:00">是因为遇到了那样的社会条件；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:02:37.072+09:00">霸王之政重威猛；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:02:37.094+09:00">所以，古代治国，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:02:37.096+09:00">依照以往的历史经验，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:02:37.248+09:00">强国之政重胁迫。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:02:37.309+09:00">实行王道或者成就霸业，也是当时的社会条件决定的。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:02:37.323+09:00">方法有三：</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:02:37.323+09:00">王道之政重教化；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:02:37.34+09:00">不能变易。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:02:37.365+09:00">各有各的方法，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:02:37.369+09:00">“圣人只能顺应时势，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:02:37.398+09:00">管仲说：</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:12:12.532+09:00">而不能违背时势。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:12:25.765+09:00">智者虽然善于谋划，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:13:04.583+09:00">但不如顺应时代高明。"</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:13:18.178+09:00">邹忌说：</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:13:43.69+09:00">"一切政治教化</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:13:51.216+09:00">都是为了匡救时弊，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:14:11.352+09:00">如果适合于当时的实际情况，就运用它，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:14:17.877+09:00">一旦过时就舍弃它。"</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:14:31.211+09:00">由此观之，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:14:58.656+09:00">在应当推行霸道的朝代却推行王道教化，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:15:14.032+09:00">那是很荒谬的；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:15:25.511+09:00">应当推行强国之术的朝代却推行霸道的威慑手段，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:15:38.781+09:00">那是很可笑的。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:15:53.048+09:00">如果时逢天下混乱，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:15:58.636+09:00">人心诡诈，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:16:05.624+09:00">传统的道德遭到破坏，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:16:39.713+09:00">而想遵从先王的传统，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:16:51.627+09:00">推行道德教化，这就好像等待越地识水性的人来救落水的人，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:16:59.872+09:00">叫尊贵的人来救火一样。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:17:05.188+09:00">好是好，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:18:06.454+09:00">但这符合我们说的“通于时变”吗？</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:19:58.99+09:00">新道</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.79" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:20:19.374+09:00">是一种白黑杂和，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.78" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:20:11.798+09:00">是一种混乱不清的政治，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.80" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:20:29.177+09:00">不单纯用道德教化的政治。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.81" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:20:38.728+09:00">这种治国方法只要求出成果，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.82" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:20:53.165+09:00">不问出成果的原因；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.83" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:21:04.836+09:00">只强调总体成效，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.84" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:21:21.927+09:00">而不顾细枝末节的弊端。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.85" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:22:53.155+09:00">这种政治</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.86" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:23:02.385+09:00">虽然不及夏、商、周三王的德育教化，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.88" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T02:24:10.789+09:00">但扶危定倾的实质是一样的。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.89" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:44:09.216+09:00">我恐儒生们被自己所闻局限，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.90" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:44:17.514+09:00">不知王道和新道的区别，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.91" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:44:28.296+09:00">所以专门叙述长短之术，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.92" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:44:52.965+09:00">用来分析通变的道理，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.93" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:55:54.071+09:00">并立题目</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.94" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:56:03.57+09:00">共六十五篇，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.95" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:56:12.809+09:00">合为九卷，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.96" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:56:21.284+09:00">书名为《反经》。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.97" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:57:18.482+09:00">本书大旨是讨论巩固统治根基，改除时弊，拨乱反正，挽救国家危局。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.98" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:57:36.546+09:00">所载诸篇，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.99" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:57:51.108+09:00">都是总结历史经验教训的深远谋略，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.100" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:58:02.183+09:00">是经邦济世的真理。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.101" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:58:29.101+09:00">我不想在此哗众取宠，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.102" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:59:13.818+09:00">博取名声。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.103" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T04:59:20.474+09:00">谨略陈固陋，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.104" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T05:00:24.175+09:00">以待来哲指教。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_001-1a.105" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-04T05:00:31.54+09:00">假如有在位的帝王，能好好地读读此书，那我就荣幸之至了！</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.1-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:17:03.166+09:00">为君之道，必须识大体，弃细务，其根本大计就是善于用人。君主之长，长于用人之长，以取长补短，这是治国理政的根本。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:18:49.426+09:00">我听、老子说过：</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:18:55.952+09:00">“用正道治理国家，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:19:03.32+09:00">用奇正领兵布阵,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:19:39.164+09:00">用无为夺取天下，这是成大事者必须掌握的最高法则。"</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:19:53.17+09:00">荀子也说：</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:20:12.351+09:00">“做帝王的人，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:20:37.505+09:00">善于识别人、善于管理人就算是有才能；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:21:49.412+09:00">平民百姓，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:22:18.431+09:00">以自己能干实事就算是有才能。”</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:22:35.634+09:00">西晋哲学家傅玄说：</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:22:58.197+09:00">"能让士大夫忠于各自的职守，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:23:32.115+09:00">让诸侯国的君主分到土地并守住它；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:23:39.127+09:00">让朝廷三公总揽天下大事并参政、议政，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:25:27.749+09:00">这样天子就可以悠哉悠哉，拱手而治理好天下了。"</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:26:15.42+09:00">怎么证明这个道理是正确的呢？</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:27:34.466+09:00">在尧那个时代，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:27:57.112+09:00">舜当司徒掌管刑罚、土地；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:28:07.248+09:00">契当司马，掌管军事；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:28:23.515+09:00">禹当司空，掌管建设；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:28:33.288+09:00">后稷当畴，掌管农业；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:29:51.572+09:00">夔当乐正，掌管音乐；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:29:51.573+09:00">佳管理工匠；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:30:01.367+09:00">伯夷掌管祭祀；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:30:10.178+09:00">皋陶掌管司法；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:30:33.455+09:00">益管理打猎。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:31:06.717+09:00">这些具体的事尧一件也不做，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:35:11.823+09:00">悠悠然只做他的帝王,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:35:28.267+09:00">而这九个人反而做了他的臣子。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:35:46.931+09:00">原因何在呢？</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:36:21.293+09:00">因为尧知道治理天下的大事是哪些，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:36:29.624+09:00">了解他们九人各自的长处，然后量才使用，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:36:41.427+09:00">而且让他们个个都成就了一番事业。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:36:59.334+09:00">这样，尧便凭借他们成就的功业而能够称王于天下。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:37:51.584+09:00">汉高祖刘邦说：</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:37:59.467+09:00">“运筹帷幄之中，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:38:09.569+09:00">决胜千里之外，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:38:45.792+09:00">我不如张良；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:38:53.772+09:00">定国安邦、</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:39:01.755+09:00">安抚百姓、</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:39:12.406+09:00">供应军需、</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:39:21.71+09:00">保证粮道畅通，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:39:21.71+09:00">保证粮道畅通，我不如萧何；连百万之军，战必胜、攻必取，我</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:39:38.686+09:00">我不如萧何；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:39:42.924+09:00">连百万之军，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:39:57.433+09:00">战必胜、</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:40:27.735+09:00">攻必取，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:40:32.061+09:00">我不如韩信。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:40:41.437+09:00">这三个人，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:40:51.648+09:00">都是人中的豪杰。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:41:01.428+09:00">我能够正确使用他们，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:42:39.632+09:00">这就是我之所以能取得天下的原因。"</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:42:53.71+09:00">三国时期的哲学家刘劭在他写的《人物志》中说：</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:43:07.514+09:00">"一个官员的职责</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:43:21.198+09:00">是以一味来协调五味，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:43:55.989+09:00">一个国家的统治者</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:46:00.659+09:00">是以无味来调和五味。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:46:16.161+09:00">所以大臣们以自己能胜任某种工作算有才能；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:46:22.926+09:00">国君却以会用人算有才能。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:46:33.512+09:00">大臣们以出谋划策、能言善辩算有才能；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:46:39.458+09:00">国君以善于听取臣民们的意见算有才能。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:46:56.226+09:00">大臣们以能身体力行算有才能；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:47:55.041+09:00">国君以赏罚得当算有才能。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:48:58.943+09:00">最高统治者正是因为不是万事通，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T01:50:05.424+09:00">所以才能统筹众多有才能的人为其服务。"</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T03:56:09.545+09:00">所以说，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T03:56:12.648+09:00">知人，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T03:56:15.836+09:00">是王道；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T03:56:19.427+09:00">知事，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T03:56:23.713+09:00">是臣道。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T03:57:27.346+09:00">无形的东西，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T03:57:40.032+09:00">是有形万物的主宰；</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T03:57:48.616+09:00">无端无形的东西，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T03:58:32.941+09:00">是事物的根本。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T03:59:02.424+09:00">鼓音不在五音之列</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T03:59:07.225+09:00">却能做五音的统帅。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.78" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T03:59:16.153+09:00">掌握了王道真谛的人，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.79" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:00:27.692+09:00">才能成为一国之主。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.80" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:01:17.574+09:00">做帝王的严守王道，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.81" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:01:29.232+09:00">当官的也知道他们应做的事，</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.82" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:01:39.572+09:00">自古而然。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_004-4a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-07T18:47:49.13+09:00">孔子说：</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_004-4a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-07T18:48:15.04+09:00">"诗、书、易、礼、乐、春秋这六艺虽然论述的问题不同，但在治理国家方面是一致的。</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_004-4a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-07T18:50:41.151+09:00">《诗经》用来表情达意，《尚书》指导如何做人,《易经》阐述万物之变，《礼记》陈述处世的规矩，《乐经》可陶冶性情，开启心智，《春秋》用来明辨道义。"</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>